# BLS School LMS - Finalization & Migration Report

The BLS School LMS is now fully production-ready, featuring a high-performance PostgreSQL (Supabase) backend and a purified data state.

## 1. PostgreSQL Migration Successful
The database has been successfully transitioned from local SQLite to a professional cloud-hosted PostgreSQL instance on Supabase.
- **Connection Established**: Using the Supabase Connection Pooler (IPv4) to ensure maximum stability and reachability.
- **Schema Applied**: All 14 application tables (Users, Classes, Fees, etc.) have been constructed in the cloud database via Prisma.
- **Data Integrity**: An automated migration script was executed to safely transfer all existing records from the local [dev.db](file:///e:/blsschool-main%20-%20Copy/backend/dev.db) to the cloud. The system is now running 100% on PostgreSQL.

